### Firebase Database Structure

```
Firestore Collections:
├── users/
│   └── {userId}/
│       ├── email: string
│       ├── name: string
│       ├── age: number
│       ├── occupation: string
│       ├── address: string
│       ├── role: string (customer|therapist|admin)
│       └── createdAt: timestamp
└── bookings/
    └── {bookingId}/
        ├── customerId: string
        ├── customerName: string
        ├── serviceType: string
        ├── scheduledDateTime: timestamp
        ├── status: string (pending|confirmed|completed|cancelled)
        ├── price: number
        ├── createdAt: timestamp
        └── updatedAt: timestamp
```

